.tmp/runs/luna6/plan-r2.md:241:  - (b) One arena round with `--cli codex --model gpt-6-luna --effort xhigh --timeout-ms 1800000` through an isolated home. This is the arena path, and it also confirms the §3.1 wall behaviour.
.tmp/runs/luna6/plan-r2.md:242:- **P1 arms are conditional on the rulings (r1 P2-1).** Every model/effort/path combination that will actually run gets measured evidence before it gets a budget. An unpiloted combination has no table entry, so the resolver fails closed (§3.3).
