.claude/decisions.md:96:- Preserve independently captured legacy-output oracles: supervisor captures on clean approved main with commit/tree/tool/clean provenance, proves reversible encoding and two-checkout equality, then records fixture hash independently. Comparing two current outputs or a pin to its production constant is insufficient. [D584/D584.16/D586.32]
