.claude/decisions.md:1303:Astra HIGH r1 (`.claude/consensus/data-01/review-plan-astra-r1.md`, session 01a0c060-51dd-7ce0-aefd-a998db269e55, 100,069 tokens; 28 `claude -p` hits = quotations). All ten planner probes reproduced, with one material correction: the 3,874 hash-valid archive captures collapse to 770 DISTINCT states (3,194 actor slots, 155 seeds, two matchup families) and lack current-schema fields — the archive is a small seed set, not a 15,691-slot corpus. P2s (12): overstated archive; total vs train counts (20k train ≈ 28.6k total) and DATA-01 cannot certify "enough" without the training unit; plateau test underpowered (needs an equivalence test); calibration target undefined (soft label vs argmax conflation); split groups not connected (716 hashes recur across tables); leakage serializer optional and the context carries recommendation aliases (`engine_default_option_id`, `better_option_id`, duplicate options array); teacher/retry policy biases (complete 18-option rankings; whole-state quarantine; cache-key conflation); fallback/replacement questions cannot be asked literally in one request, and DOMINATED options are rejected by engine-server without a typed override; producer capabilities misstated (no party-pack/family wiring; branching unowned; Batch 2 depends on Batch 3); sidecar needs seed injection and full option execution, not just an id bridge; budget rule authorises a 10% overrun and the 8k-output case already consumes $285 of $300; D694 lane overlap unsequenced. RULINGS: D694 lane files are off-limits to DATA-01 until B18 lands (dependency table required); hard ceiling includes pilot/retries with pre-dispatch reservation and stop-before-cap (owner asked: $300 vs $500); the Responses/Vercel teacher route is new Batch-3 work with effective-parameter evidence; DATA-01 delivers a candidate corpus + harness, sufficiency is certified by the training unit; owner questions reworded per astra (DM style Luna should prefer / total hard limit / primary+fallback only vs adjustments) plus the human-audit owner. Fix r1 dispatched on the resumed session (`plan-fix-r1.md`, ≤560 lines); this is round 1 of 3. Next free id: D836.
