.claude/decisions.md:1315:PUBLISH-01: planner (resumed sol 01a0bc7e…, exit 0, 2,956,340 tokens; 7 `claude -p` hits = quotations). Plan 599 lines sha f26942275cc08f1771eaea1c333947c553717762b89f5f38a7bc6305e0c34780; ledger 158 lines sha 03239215ad8f84ed441e9c5d997398546e89c22e780279b8b1d83c297e69fa1b; generator 959 lines sha 473cc1ca0a206cbc517667cdf98b04924dfab9e312172c90565aa8f795aaf7c6 — VERIFIED. Codex reports: content-vector binding (F = sorted [path, mode, oid, size]; D hashes F; no enclosing SHA), scratch-clone committed-manifest witness, Pi MCP cwd retained (174 exceptions / 19 rewrites), F/D slots in every content batch, 21 batches ≤10. I RAN `--audit 1218f20e`: retain=174 rewrite=19, block byte-equal apart from the heading. Astra HIGH r10 dispatched with a scratch-commit publish test. DATA-01: planner (resumed sol 01a0c045-9146…, exit 0, 699,495 tokens; 38 `claude -p` hits = quotations) → 348 lines sha 89e30009e9a9fe066e302cef061951e07b5fb212091bafb1604c7158413d11bd, all 12 P2 + 3 P3 tagged; owner questions reworded (DM style; $300 vs $500 total hard cap, rec. $500; primary/fallback vs + adjustments). Astra HIGH r2 dispatched (round 2 of 3). Next free id: D839.
