.tmp/runs/luna6/review-r2.log:8927:No: r2 does not yet implement exactly D887, no more and no less.
.tmp/runs/luna6/review-r2.log:8931:- The no-flag Sol/medium defaults and legacy pins remain untouched ([plan-r2.md:39-47](/home/vagrant/PhpstormProjects/dnd-multiclass-spells-static/.tmp/runs/luna6/plan-r2.md:39)).
